<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Q1 industry orders rise 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Q1 industry orders rise 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders received by Swiss industry in the first quarter rose 4.2 percent from the fourth quarter of 1996 for a year-on-year rise of 0.8 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				     Q1	  Q4 1996   Q1 1996</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		+0.8	0.0	 -1.0</p>
<p> Index (1975 average=100)    102.6     98.5	101.8</p>
<p>Domestic orders</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		-2.7	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>Foreign orders</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		+14.2     n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>Orders on hand</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		+7.1	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p> Index (1975 average =100)   93.8	87.6	91.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The office said it had revised the fourth quarter order index from an originally reported 98.4 and the fourth quarter orders-on-hand index from an original 87.8.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
